# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000102> (executes)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000102> "relationship between a planned process and the plan specification that it carries out; it is defined as equivalent to the composed relationship (realizes o concretizes)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000102> "AGB")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/STATO_0000102> "executes")

