AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020119> "aggregate state gaseous"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020119> "A state where the entities have no bonding."@en)

